# Published ConceptMem benchmark results. Only results, reports and the scripts or configs
# that reproduce them belong here; the inputs they were computed from do not.

# The LongMemEval release files: fetched by `node scripts/download-data.mjs` (and
# longmemeval_s_cleaned.json alone is 265 MB, past GitHub's 100 MB file limit).
longmemeval_s*.json
longmemeval_m*.json
longmemeval_oracle*.json
**/data/

# Caches the benchmark keeps between runs: embeddings, LLM extractions and QA answers.
**/embeddings/
**/extractions/
**/qa/
*.f32
*.bin
*.jsonl.gz
*.gguf
*.part

# Secrets and local tooling.
.env
.env.*
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
